    <mxCell id="an_good_T176" value="&lt;div style='width:426px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;padding:8px 14px;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:10.8px;font-weight:900;color:#065F46;'&gt;✓ COVARIANCE OOD RADIUS GATE:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style='font-size:12.2px;color:#0F172A;font-weight:600;'&gt;&lt;b&gt;Check d_cov ≤ 4.5τ in 3ms → abstain cleanly on out-of-domain&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#A7F3D0;strokeWidth=1.4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="462" y="140" width="434" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

    <mxCell id="lt_tl" value="&lt;div style='width:400px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;'&gt;&lt;div style='margin-bottom:4px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;'&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#DC2626;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:10.2px;font-weight:900;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;SILENT COVARIATE DRIFT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#FEE2E2;color:#991B1B;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;Extrapolation Trap&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;line-height:1.18;'&gt;Forcing Your Agent to Hallucinate on Alien Topics&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12px;color:#334155;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.32;'&gt;When user prompts drift outside your corpus manifold (&lt;b&gt;d&lt;sub&gt;cov&lt;/sub&gt; &amp;gt; 4.5&lt;/b&gt;), nearest-neighbor RAG still returns &lt;b&gt;top-5 irrelevant chunks&lt;/b&gt;!&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:19px;font-weight:900;color:#DC2626;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.05;'&gt;100% Confident Nonsense&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="38" y="212" width="404" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lt_tr" value="&lt;div style='width:400px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;'&gt;&lt;div style='margin-bottom:4px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;'&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#059669;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:10.2px;font-weight:900;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;COVARIANCE DENSITY GATE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#D1FAE5;color:#065F46;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;Manifold Geometry&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;line-height:1.18;'&gt;Gate Every Query Against Valid Embedding Centroids in 3ms&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12px;color:#334155;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.32;'&gt;Namespace embeddings strictly by model ID (&lt;code&gt;gemini-embedding-2&lt;/code&gt;) and reject queries beyond &lt;b&gt;ellipsoid radius τ&lt;/b&gt; before LLM call.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:19px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.05;'&gt;98.6% OOD &amp; Drift Catch&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="478" y="212" width="404" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lt_bot" value="&lt;div style='width:832px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;background:#F8FAFC;border:1.4px solid #CBD5E1;border-radius:16px;padding:9px 13px;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='margin-bottom:4px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;'&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#0F172A;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:10.2px;font-weight:900;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;MNEMONIC: L · A · T · E · N · T&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#DBEAFE;color:#1E40AF;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;Representation Space&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;line-height:1.18;'&gt;Lock Embedding Model ID • Anchor Cluster Centroids • Track Covariance Radius • Eject Out-of-Hull Drift • Name Emerging Intents • Tune Threshold&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12px;color:#334155;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.32;'&gt;Weekly UMAP inspection of &lt;b&gt;high-radius OOD queries&lt;/b&gt; discovers emerging customer intents weeks before support tickets spike.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="42" y="788" width="836" height="122" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

    <mxCell id="c1_T176" value="&lt;div style='width:266px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;padding:10px 14px;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:10.5px;font-weight:800;color:#7C3AED;letter-spacing:0.4px;'&gt;◆ 30s STAFF+ INTERVIEW PITCH&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12.3px;color:#0F172A;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.33;'&gt;&amp;ldquo;Top-k cosine search always returns k items even in empty space; we gate RAG with a &lt;b&gt;3ms covariance density check&lt;/b&gt; on version-pinned embeddings.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=24;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.4;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="26" y="984" width="274" height="94" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

